        "identifier": "https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/CoarseGraining",
        "note": "The CoarseGraining library (Armstrong, Kuusi) supplies the coefficient fields, weak derivatives and Sobolev spaces, triadic cubes, cube averages and Poincaré inequalities; pinned as a Lake dependency.",
