        "identifier": "https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/DeGiorgi",
        "note": "For symmetric coefficients in d >= 3, the uniformly elliptic comparator theorems here give the Harnack inequality with constant exp(C sqrt(Lambda/lambda)), the weak Harnack inequality with constants of the same form for every exponent below d/(d-2), and local boundedness with every power kappa > (d-1)/4 of 1 + Lambda/lambda, as consequences of results for degenerate and unbounded coefficients. Not superseded: DeGiorgi's Hölder continuity, its nonsymmetric coefficients, and its statements on balls for H^1 weak solutions.",
